          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're under the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Enter Spirit Trance].</p><hr /><p>You manifest a defensive quality of spirits all around, such as the thick hide of an animal spirit or the sturdy bark of a nature spirit. Choose bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing. You gain resistance equal to half your level to that damage type for the duration of your spirit trance.</p>\n<p>If you use Invoke Defense again, you can choose a different type of damage, but you lose the previous resistance.</p>"
