          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail or critically fail a saving throw against a curse, death, emotion, or fear effect.</p><hr /><p>You leverage your emotional turmoil to mend your physical form. You regain @Damage[(2*(max(1,(@actor.system.skills.athletics.rank - 1))))d8[healing]] Hit Points. If you're a master in Athletics, you regain 4d8 Hit Points instead. If you're legendary in Athletics, you regain 6d8 Hit Points instead.</p>"
